Local changes of openwoot to TinyUSB.

Base:    https://github.com/hathach/tinyusb commit f452ab745ef953d74704bc5429ff16a80a5b325a
         ("overwrite grstctl on edpt_disable", 2022-05-03)
Applies: inside third_party/tinyusb (patch -p1) on the unmodified files of that commit.
Result:  the tree in third_party/tinyusb.

Every change is marked /* openwoot: ... */ in the source; the comment says what
the change does and why this firmware needs it.

